    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to Garbageland! Your name is Worm! You and your grandma are scavengers, digging through the dangerous, trash-filled wastes of the past. One day,\u00a0she's injured, and you're forced to set out on your own. What follows is a bizarre, quirky adventure where the garbage of the past intersect with the realities of the future.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Garbageland</strong> is a Breakout/billiards inspired RPG that's in active development! Almost entirely a solo-developer project, I hope you'll support its development by trying the demo and adding it to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn sticker book aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging turn-based gameplay with elements of Breakout, billiards, and golf</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pit your enemies against each other and the environment in order to progress and uncover valuable salvage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic cast of characters with unique skills that encourage puzzle-style problem solving</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to Garbageland! Your name is Worm! You and your grandma are scavengers, digging through the dangerous, trash-filled wastes of the past. One day,\u00a0she's injured, and you're forced to set out on your own. What follows is a bizarre, quirky adventure where the garbage of the past intersect with the realities of the future.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Garbageland</strong> is a Breakout/billiards inspired RPG that's in active development! Almost entirely a solo-developer project, I hope you'll support its development by trying the demo and adding it to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn sticker book aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging turn-based gameplay with elements of Breakout, billiards, and golf</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pit your enemies against each other and the environment in order to progress and uncover valuable salvage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic cast of characters with unique skills that encourage puzzle-style problem solving</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A Breakout-style RPG about a magical, trash-filled future. Use the environment against your enemies and scavenge useful treasures from the past. Features a dynamic cast of characters with a lovingly hand-draw sticker-book aesthetic.",
